# RESTLESS: the demo player's cherry plan, with real button presses from the
# title: it walks into foes on purpose until it has four deaths, so the
# world pays more and the Bridgekeeper comes blue (twelve gold beetles),
# then plays the game through and lays the King to rest with more than
# 50,000 points.
seed 3
game restless
wait 10
cheat botplan 1
botuntil half >= 1 30000
expect score >= 12000
botuntil half >= 3 60000
botuntil half >= 5 80000
botuntil state == 9 40000
expect won == 1
expect save_best_won >= 50000
expect goals == 7
